{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36333","headline":"题新竹 · 方干","name":"题新竹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青苔斸破植贞坚，细碧竿排郁眼鲜。\n小凤凰声吹嫩叶，短蛟龙尾褭轻烟。\n节环腻色端匀粉，根拔秋光暗长鞭。\n怪得入门肌骨冷，缀风黏月满庭前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36333.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36333","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}